# macOS
.DS_Store

# Documents and research
*.doc

# Large regeneratable intermediate pipeline stages (data/processed/) —
# see README.md's "Data included in this repository" section: only the
# final, analysis-ready Parquet files in data/processed/ are tracked;
# these three PGN-tree stages are excluded and regeneratable from
# data/games/ (given the external dependencies documented in README.md).
data/processed/Updated_Ratings/
data/processed/Updated_Time/
data/processed/Updated_engine_eval/

# Large external third-party dataset (official FIDE monthly rating lists
# only) — not ours to redistribute at this size/licensing; see
# data/Rating_lists/README.md for how to obtain it. The rest of
# data/Rating_lists/ (the project's own manually-compiled roster CSVs,
# .xlsx, and this README) is NOT excluded — it's our own compiled work
# product, not FIDE's redistributable data, and isn't reproducible by any
# script in this repo, so it needs to ship with the repo to be usable at
# all. See data/Rating_lists/README.md's provenance note.
data/Rating_lists/FIDE_Rating_by_id_month/


# Text files (except requirements)
*.txt
!requirements.txt
data/results/*_otb_*
data/processed/*_otb*
